    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συσπάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw together, contract</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				71c
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίημι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				949a9
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέρμα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				888a39
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				65
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεσπᾰκὼς τοὺς δακτύλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὀφρῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰς κοχώνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					482
				</span></i>
			(s.v.l.):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be drawn up, retracted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				508a21
			</span></i>, etc.; but also, <i>to be shrivelled up</i> by fire, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>La.</u>
				5.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεσπασμένους</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμένους ὑπὸ νόσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					6.92
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεσπασμένοι καὶ κακοπινεῖς</span>
			<i>shrivelled</i> and dirty, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.565d
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι ἰσχνοὶ καὶ
			συνεσπ</span>. dry and <i>shrunken</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>draw together</i> by stitching, <i>sew together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφθέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.5.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <i>draw along with one</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
